        <p><hi rend="bold" source="#source-15891-15927"><seg source="#source-15891-15897">舞妓</seg></hi><seg source="#source-15927-15930">　</seg><hi rend="bouten 丸傍点 right" source="#source-15930-15963"><seg source="#source-15930-15933">紅</seg></hi><seg source="#source-15963-15966">　</seg><hi rend="bouten 丸傍点 right" source="#source-15966-16011"><seg source="#source-15966-15975">黄世子</seg></hi><seg source="#source-16011-16115">　　歌島　定子　　三条　健子　　辰巳　鈴子　　香川桃代　　平河みね子</seg></p>
        <p><hi rend="bold" source="#source-16115-16157"><seg source="#source-16115-16124">喜多八</seg></hi><seg source="#source-16157-16181">　丸木　花作　　</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-16181-16217"><seg source="#source-16181-16187">弥次</seg></hi><seg source="#source-16217-16237">　鴨川　布助</seg></p>
